## Compatibility and trust boundary

Absent/false fields retain output-only behavior and omit the manifest field.
Older strict workflow or manifest parsers reject the new field instead of
silently changing authority. Configured seat harnesses are the enforcement
boundary for prompt/tool policy; cwd is not claimed as an OS sandbox. The
manifest is an audit record, never an authorization input.

